/**
 * Stage 03 unit tests: ADR-011 extraction, text utilities, fact extraction, candidate checks, outcome guard bases,
 * FQ-01..FQ-20 builder and the candidate dataset. Fixture journals: tests/stage03/fixtures/sites.json (generated by
 * tests/crawler/fixtures/stage03_sites.py for reference date 2026-10-01; coverage finished 2026-10-01).
 * Test IDs (S3-...) are referenced from docs/stage03/traceability-matrix.md.
